            %p is homotopy cartesian.
          %p
            This fact was observed in (
            %a{:href => "#BunkeNikolausVoelkl13"}> Bunke-Nikolaus-Völkl 13, prop. 3.5
            ). It may be thought of as an incarnation of the concept of a
            = succeed "." do
