            %a{:href => "#BunkeNikolausVoelkl13"}> Bunke-Nikolaus-Völkl 13, prop. 3.5
            )).
          %p
            The following says that not only does, by prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TheDifferentialFractureSquare"}>
            , the
            = succeed "-" do
