            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fracture+square"} fracture square
            exhibit any stable cohesive homotopy type as the pullback of a
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
